   "resumo_en": "The Great Execution is the eighth studio album by Brazilian death metal band Krisiun. It was released on 31 October 2011 by Century Media Records and produced by Andy Classen. The album was made available as a digital download, CD and vinyl format, including a limited edition transparent red edition. A limited-edition version of the album contains a re-recording of the track \"Black Force Domain\". A music video for \"The Will To Potency\" was released on 13 December 2012. A music video for \"Blood of Lions\" was released on 16 October 2014.",
